volutpat.</p>
</div>
<p>Text before the second image ends here.</p>
<p><img src="../images/orgmode/org-mode-unicorn.png" alt="org-mode-unicorn.png" style="float:left;margin:20px 20px 20px 0px;"></p>
<p>This text is directly following the second image. No empty lines are added.
Neither before, nor after the image. We therefor see one big paragraph with
two images. Note, that browsers will place this second image where ever they
see fit. Browsers will not interrupt the text flow, just to place the image
add the exact point between two words.</p>
