</div>
<h3 id="italic-captions">Italic captions</h3>
<p>Captions are often printed in italics. To do so, go to the top of your
Org-file again, and edit the styles again:</p>
<pre><code>#+STYLE: &#x3C;style type="text/css">
#+STYLE:&#x3C;!--/*-->&#x3C;![CDATA[/*>&#x3C;!--*/
#+STYLE: div.figure p { font-style:italic; }
#+STYLE: /*]]>*/-->
#+STYLE: &#x3C;/style>
</code></pre>
<div class="minipage">
<p></p>
    <div class="figure" style="float:right;">
    <p><img src="/worg/images/orgmode/org-mode-unicorn.png" alt="Save the unicorns" /></p>
    <p style="font-style:italic;">Save the unicorns</p>
    </div>
